n  the country  even though the colombian government  signed a peace deal with the farc in  2016  some parts of the country continue to  live in conflict  the left-wing rebel group known as the  eln composed of around 2 500 fighters  announced they were ready for talks with  petros government  and that's why people like doralina are  excited about this new beginning for the  country  an era she hopes where dialogue and not  war will prevail  [Music]
 

